      "sourceTextSha256": "7d939a849f37c7a8bb14e83809490415c16a852f0f39fde127b401a08c0231d9",
      "text": "Day 4 · After breakfast, a scenic drive to Quilotoa, stopping at a Tigua art workshop, with its colourful paintings of Andean life. At the Quilotoa crater, admire the emerald-green lake inside the volcano, ringed by steep, jagged cliffs: hike down to the shore and return to the rim on foot or by mule; kayaking on the lake is optional. (B)",
