    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b04d5d61d358e759",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "7ac37670409aad45887d0aac8e6b549661b452e740ee91311a5bd4c27fd4faba",
      "text": "Day 5 · Breakfast and transfer to the airport for your flight to the Galápagos. On landing at Baltra, your guide meets you to cross the Itabaca Channel (10 minutes) to Santa Cruz, then up to the highlands to watch giant tortoises in their natural habitat; the islands take their name from these iconic animals (galápagos). Look out for Darwin’s finches and other birds amid the endemic vegetation of scalesia and matazarno forests. Free time in Puerto Ayora and its craft shops. (B, L)",
